    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l9c81l0",
      "content": "Nursing Research is the systematic investigation designed to develop or contribute to generalizable knowledge that improves nursing practice, education, and patient outcomes. Statistics is an essential tool in nursing research used to collect, analyze, interpret, and present data. In nursing competitive examinations such as RRB Nursing, questions frequently come from research methods, types of research, sampling techniques, data collection methods, and basic statistical measures."
    },
